  "mistakes": [],
  "hints": [
    "Write 1/√n as 1/nᵖ. What is p?",
    "A p-series converges exactly when p > 1."
  ],
  "solution": [
    "$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt n} = \\frac{1}{n^{1/2}}$ is a p-series with $p = \\tfrac12 \\le 1$.",
    "So the series diverges."
  ],
  "reference": {
